CONTRACT marketplace-sales-operator
DELEGATED_BY organization:constitutional-authority
PRINCIPAL bot:marketplace-sales

ALLOW MODEL marketplace-sales.pl.aql
ALLOW OQL marketplace.account.preflight
ALLOW OQL marketplace.listing.draft
ALLOW OQL marketplace.listing.publish
ALLOW OQL human.work.assign
ALLOW OQL evidence.seal
ALLOW URI_PROCESS marketplace://**
ALLOW URI_PROCESS legal://commerce/**
ALLOW URI_PROCESS human://registry/actor/query/available
ALLOW URI_PROCESS evidence://marketplace/**
ALLOW EMAIL_DOMAIN subactor.com

LIMIT STEPS 80
LIMIT EXECUTIONS 5000
EXPIRES 2030-12-31T23:59:59Z
